<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz E ups rights in new issue.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz E ups rights in new issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish construction firm Elektromontaz Export SA will be offered one million shares from the firm's planned two-million-share issue, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company had previously planned to offer current shareholders a tranche of 500,000 new shares.</p>
<p>The tranche of one million shares will be offered to current shareholders seven days before the subscription.</p>
<p>Elektromontaz currently has 8,665,500 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
